Bind Npc 29070 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 29071 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 783 "[Crack of All Means] The Second Mission"
    Journal for karus "You must perform the mission assigned by [Advisor] Herga."
    Journal for elmorad "You must perform the mission assigned by [Advisor] Nez."
    Collect 1 of 900338000

Requires player level >= 52 and quest 782 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Visit Gator to get the next mission."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Visit Noker to get the next mission."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "We still have no idea what's causing it. We need more info."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You have [Haoong Clan Blood Sample]?\n\nDeliver [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood Sample] to Gator following what Herga has ordered."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We still have no idea what's causing it. We need more info."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You have [Haoong Clan Blood Sample]?\n\nDeliver [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood Sample] to Gator following what Nez has ordered."

On in_progress
    Say "But I can't seem to find the sample. I don't think you have it."

On claimable
    Show quest "OH!!!  Interesting...\n\nSince we have the [Haoong Clan Blood Sample] I need something that'll can be compaired with. I'll send you to a place where you can collect [Contaminated Haoong's Warrior Blood], [Contaminated Powder Nut Blood]."
